Subject: [PATCH v6 2/6] drm/mediatek: Remove the pointer of struct cmdq_client
Date: Thu, 28 Oct 2021 18:19:08 +0800
Message-ID: <20211028101912.4624-3-jason-jh.lin@mediatek.com>
